Petstore API Automation Testing
A Python-based API Automation Testing Framework using Pytest and Requests to validate REST API endpoints from Swagger Petstore.

This project demonstrates Positive and Negative API Testing, reusable API clients, test data management, assertions, and automated HTML test reporting.

Tech Stack
1. Python
2. Pytest
3. Requests
4. HTML & CSS (Custom Test Report)

