Prerequisites
Before running this project, make sure you have installed:
    1. Python 3.9 or higher
    2. pip (Python package manager)
    3. Git
    4. Code editor (VS Code recommended)

Installation & Setup
    1. Clone the repository
    2. Create a virtual environment
        * macOS / Linux >> python3 -m venv venv, source venv/bin/activate
        * Windows >> python -m venv venv, venv\Scripts\activate

Install dependencies
    1. pip install -r requirements.txt

Verify installation
    1. python --version
    2. pytest --version

Running the Tests
    1. Run all test cases >> python -m pytest -v -s
    2. Run a specific test file >> python -m pytest tests/test_user_api.py -v -s
    3. Run a specific test case >> python -m pytest tests/test_user_api.py::test_get_user_data_valid -v -s

HTML Test Report
This framework includes a custom HTML report generator.
The report is generated automatically after the Pytest execution finishes.

Report location >> reports/petstore_api_report.html

Open HTML Report
macOS >> open reports/petstore_api_report.html
Windows >> start reports/petstore_api_report.html